-`10⁻³⁶` (relative) for `λ ∈ [0, 3]`. Natively compiled, one `gphi` takes about 0.25 ms and one
-`w`/`winv` about 0.6 ms (on a loaded machine); `cpa` and `jnew` a few ms, `vUpper` about 20 ms.
--/
-
